## 4. Gateway overhead

Stdio MCP everywhere; the gateway fronts 10 upstream servers. `tools/list` in all mode returns 1,520 tools (191,979 tokens); in meta mode 3 tools (168 tokens).

| path | operation | concurrent callers | p50 | p99 |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| direct to one MCP server | tools/call | 1 | 0.16 ms | 0.39 ms |
| through gateway (all mode) | tools/call | 1 | 0.39 ms | 0.79 ms |
| direct to one MCP server | tools/call | 8 | 0.29 ms | 0.82 ms |
| through gateway (all mode) | tools/call | 8 | 0.71 ms | 2.05 ms |
| gateway (meta mode) | search_tools over all tools | 1 | 2.98 ms | 11.67 ms |
| gateway (meta mode) | load_tool | 1 | 0.17 ms | 0.49 ms |

Added by the gateway at 1 concurrent caller(s): p50 +0.22 ms, p99 +0.40 ms.

Added by the gateway at 8 concurrent caller(s): p50 +0.42 ms, p99 +1.23 ms.

